1
00:01:33,450 --> 00:01:34,930
[OVERDO]

2
00:01:35,250 --> 00:01:37,710
[Episode 19]

3
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:43,509
How is it?

4
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:46,380
We need to take the bus?

5
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:47,310
Where to?

6
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:48,789
Home.

7
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,680
Before the orphanage,

8
00:01:55,150 --> 00:01:57,150
didn't you always live on the wharf?

9
00:02:06,710 --> 00:02:07,680
My family,

10
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:10,400
like most families on wharves,

11
00:02:10,870 --> 00:02:12,870
made a living from water transport.

12
00:02:13,750 --> 00:02:15,840
My father worked on boats all year round,

13
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:18,400
and my mother did odd jobs to help out.

14
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:21,800
We weren't rich,

15
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:23,910
but it was stable

16
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,240
and peaceful.

17
00:02:31,079 --> 00:02:32,870
Every time my father
came back from a trip,

18
00:02:32,870 --> 00:02:34,600
he'd bring me little trinkets.

19
00:02:35,750 --> 00:02:37,210
My mother was a great cook.

20
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:39,079
Every spring,

21
00:02:39,430 --> 00:02:41,430
she'd make me
pork soup with bamboo shoots,

22
00:02:41,430 --> 00:02:42,190
Yanduxian.

23
00:02:46,310 --> 00:02:47,840
Even after all these years,

24
00:02:48,710 --> 00:02:51,079
when I barely remember
what she looked like,

25
00:02:51,079 --> 00:02:52,030
I still remember

26
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:53,940
the taste of that soup.

27
00:03:03,630 --> 00:03:04,520
Papa!

28
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:07,630
Papa, Mama wants you back for dinner!

29
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:13,870
Papa, Papa!
Mama wants you back for dinner!

30
00:03:15,150 --> 00:03:16,590
Set sail!

31
00:03:16,590 --> 00:03:18,190
Go, go!

32
00:03:18,750 --> 00:03:19,079
Sail!

33
00:03:19,079 --> 00:03:20,560
-Sail!
-Go!

34
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:21,470
Go!

35
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:23,220
Go to Chonghai County!

36
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:25,190
What do you mean Chonghai County?

37
00:03:25,190 --> 00:03:26,310
My baby's boat is

38
00:03:26,590 --> 00:03:27,840
going to Spain

39
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,079
and America!

40
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:31,430
Papa,

41
00:03:31,630 --> 00:03:32,630
when I grow up,

42
00:03:33,030 --> 00:03:34,280
I want to be a captain,

43
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,160
traveling the world!

44
00:03:36,430 --> 00:03:37,430
Travel the world!

45
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:43,480
What's wrong,

46
00:03:43,910 --> 00:03:44,630
Sweetie?

47
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:47,520
But the captains

48
00:03:48,079 --> 00:03:49,630
on your wharf always

49
00:03:50,030 --> 00:03:51,840
leave for months at a time.

50
00:03:52,910 --> 00:03:55,120
I want to be with you and Mama forever.

51
00:03:58,310 --> 00:03:59,560
Don't worry.

52
00:03:59,870 --> 00:04:01,000
When the time comes,

53
00:04:01,150 --> 00:04:02,150
our whole family

54
00:04:02,710 --> 00:04:04,150
will be on your ship.

55
00:04:04,630 --> 00:04:05,960
I'll be your first mate,

56
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,710
and Mama your second mate.

57
00:04:07,710 --> 00:04:08,590
Our family

58
00:04:08,910 --> 00:04:10,360
will never ever be apart,

59
00:04:10,470 --> 00:04:11,030
okay?

60
00:04:11,190 --> 00:04:11,840
Okay!

61
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,400
Good girl.

62
00:04:14,750 --> 00:04:16,000
If you two

63
00:04:16,190 --> 00:04:17,600
really care about me,

64
00:04:17,829 --> 00:04:19,750
hurry home and eat now.

65
00:04:20,390 --> 00:04:22,360
You'll be good and eat your food,

66
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:24,160
and Papa will wash the dishes.

67
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:25,560
Then you can go back
to your world-traveling

68
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,600
daydreams, okay?

69
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:27,600
Okay!

70
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,100
Your Mama's right.

71
00:04:29,630 --> 00:04:31,560
How can you be the greatest captain

72
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:33,159
if you don't eat well?

73
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:42,040
Be a great captain!

74
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:43,920
Our baby will succeed!

75
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:04,720
I'm glad you

76
00:05:06,750 --> 00:05:08,210
opened up to me about this.

77
00:05:12,390 --> 00:05:14,320
I just suddenly got reminded of it.

78
00:05:41,430 --> 00:05:42,240
And then?

79
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:43,880
What happened after?

80
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:49,430
Later, due to an accident,

81
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:51,170
I lost my family.

82
00:05:52,240 --> 00:05:53,120
And then,

83
00:05:54,750 --> 00:05:56,000
I became Fang Mulan.

84
00:05:58,159 --> 00:05:59,290
But the person I knew

85
00:05:59,950 --> 00:06:01,350
has always been Ren Susu.

86
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:07,760
But you've never known
the real Ren Susu...

87
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:13,510
The Ren Susu who

88
00:06:13,830 --> 00:06:14,680
grew up carefree

89
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:16,750
by her parents' side 12 years ago.

90
00:06:17,870 --> 00:06:19,600
After entering the orphanage,

91
00:06:21,430 --> 00:06:22,560
She was shattered

92
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:24,040
and ruined

93
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:25,730
by those demons.

94
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:28,800
Ever since then,

95
00:06:31,390 --> 00:06:33,450
my heart's been consumed by revenge.

96
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:35,430
For revenge,

97
00:06:36,950 --> 00:06:38,920
I turned into a person full of lies,

98
00:06:40,070 --> 00:06:41,430
with blood on my hands.

99
00:06:42,510 --> 00:06:43,720
I really don't know what

100
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:44,980
my parents would think

101
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:47,060
if they saw who I am now.

102
00:06:57,830 --> 00:06:59,000
Are you trying to say

103
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:01,830
that the innocent,

104
00:07:02,950 --> 00:07:03,830
brave, wise,

105
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:05,120
and kind

106
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:07,040
Ren Susu I know

107
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:10,390
isn't the real you?

108
00:07:15,310 --> 00:07:16,270
Then tell me,

109
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:18,220
what's the real you

110
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,430
actually like?

111
00:07:26,070 --> 00:07:28,070
What I'm actually like...

112
00:07:32,190 --> 00:07:33,390
I've long forgotten.

113
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:35,720
Anyway...

114
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,430
Do you feel that

115
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:46,040
you've forgotten your past self

116
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:48,800
and gotten used to this current self

117
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:50,840
who doesn't deserve to be loved?

118
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:57,310
Haven't I also once...

119
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:01,620
felt that I don't deserve to be loved?

120
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,160
Mother,

121
00:08:03,870 --> 00:08:06,390
Qingyi's also a biological son
of the Murong family.

122
00:08:06,390 --> 00:08:07,800
Why can't he stay at home?

123
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:10,850
He caused your father's death.

124
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:13,290
Keeping him here

125
00:08:14,390 --> 00:08:16,720
will only bring misfortune to our family.

126
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:20,090
Are you going to send him back
to the Li family?

127
00:08:23,390 --> 00:08:25,190
Do you think they still want him?

128
00:08:31,510 --> 00:08:32,270
Fine.

129
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:35,260
If no one wants him,

130
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:37,870
I'll take this little brother.

131
00:08:41,030 --> 00:08:42,890
You won't have to worry about him.

132
00:08:57,960 --> 00:08:58,960
You and I have

133
00:09:00,030 --> 00:09:02,160
always been cut from the same cloth...

134
00:09:04,150 --> 00:09:05,270
Unwanted

135
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:07,030
and unvalued.

136
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:09,890
How could I not understand?

137
00:09:27,790 --> 00:09:30,630
Don't speak of yourself like this
in front of me again.

138
00:09:30,630 --> 00:09:33,490
It just feels like
you're indirectly insulting me.

139
00:09:40,510 --> 00:09:41,630
From now on,

140
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,330
Ren Susu's past is known

141
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:46,150
not only to you

142
00:09:46,510 --> 00:09:47,310
but also to me.

143
00:09:48,870 --> 00:09:51,120
So she still exists within you.

144
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:12,630
When the Huos are dealt with,

145
00:10:12,630 --> 00:10:14,230
I want to be Ren Susu again...

146
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,760
and do what she truly wants to do.

147
00:10:20,360 --> 00:10:22,600
What does Ren Susu truly want to do?

148
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:30,750
I guess

149
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:32,790
it must be about me.

150
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:35,760
Don't flatter yourself.

151
00:10:36,750 --> 00:10:39,030
When you left me to confront the Huos,

152
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:40,750
I knew you

153
00:10:41,150 --> 00:10:42,550
couldn't bear to lose me.

154
00:10:43,150 --> 00:10:44,680
It's you dying I can't bear,

155
00:10:45,150 --> 00:10:46,080
not losing you.

156
00:10:57,530 --> 00:10:59,320
♪ Running toward you ♪

157
00:11:00,020 --> 00:11:02,160
♪ From the day I thought ♪

158
00:11:02,190 --> 00:11:05,160
♪ I succeeded in forgetting you ♪

159
00:11:06,730 --> 00:11:08,590
♪ Facing the past ♪

160
00:11:08,670 --> 00:11:11,090
♪ With you inside ♪

161
00:11:11,170 --> 00:11:13,060
♪ My resolve crumbles ♪

162
00:11:13,130 --> 00:11:15,310
♪ Immediately ♪

163
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:15,390
Isn't me dying and you losing me

164
00:11:15,330 --> 00:11:17,770
♪ You're becoming clear ♪

165
00:11:15,390 --> 00:11:16,480
the same thing?

166
00:11:17,870 --> 00:11:19,900
♪ So far yet so clear ♪

167
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:21,270
Can't you say something nice to me

168
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:22,660
♪ Ever since forgetting you ♪

169
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:22,440
for a change?

170
00:11:22,740 --> 00:11:25,300
♪ Became second nature ♪

171
00:11:24,030 --> 00:11:25,120
What does it

172
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:26,080
matter to you?

173
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:27,150
Of course it matters.

174
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:28,740
♪ I still can't erase ♪

175
00:11:27,550 --> 00:11:28,960
If you say nice things,

176
00:11:28,950 --> 00:11:30,960
♪ Completely erase ♪

177
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:30,720
I'll be very happy.

178
00:11:31,340 --> 00:11:35,640
♪ The certainty of my hand in yours ♪

179
00:11:35,730 --> 00:11:37,930
♪ You are so clear ♪

180
00:11:38,050 --> 00:11:39,880
♪ So close and so clear ♪

181
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:40,060
Can you give me a little more time?

182
00:11:40,700 --> 00:11:45,500
♪ If you possibly still have the courage ♪

183
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:43,180
Let me find the Ren Susu in me back.

184
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:46,120
Of course.

185
00:11:45,520 --> 00:11:50,040
♪ Then take me away from here ♪

186
00:11:50,590 --> 00:11:52,820
♪ Having loved you deeply ♪

187
00:11:53,010 --> 00:11:56,500
♪ Was the best decision I've made ♪

188
00:12:26,270 --> 00:12:27,400
I had Lieutenant Wei

189
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:28,600
release Laiyi.

190
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,480
It was so dangerous today.

191
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:33,210
Why'd you have to get involved?

192
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:38,510
For her, of course.

193
00:12:39,910 --> 00:12:42,510
You have absolutely
no reservations now, huh?

194
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:46,030
Qingyu,

195
00:12:46,480 --> 00:12:47,960
the dust has settled.

196
00:12:48,630 --> 00:12:49,440
It's time

197
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:51,000
for you to let go.

198
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:06,010
The engagement is still on.

199
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:09,000
I've talked it over with Mother.

200
00:13:09,440 --> 00:13:10,240
Tomorrow,

201
00:13:10,790 --> 00:13:12,990
I'll take her to try on wedding dresses.

202
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:14,580
You stay home and recover.

203
00:13:14,790 --> 00:13:16,120
When you're recovered,

204
00:13:16,230 --> 00:13:17,430
I'll send you abroad.

205
00:13:18,270 --> 00:13:19,800
The engagement is still on?

206
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:24,790
Qingyu,

207
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:27,520
you already know she's Ren Susu.

208
00:13:28,150 --> 00:13:29,910
Why do you still insist on marrying her?

209
00:13:29,910 --> 00:13:31,670
For three years, she acted recklessly

210
00:13:31,670 --> 00:13:33,270
in her bid to take on the Huos.

211
00:13:33,870 --> 00:13:35,000
If I don't keep her by my side,

212
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:36,840
how many more lives
do you have to give her?

213
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:38,030
Her moving back into our home

214
00:13:38,030 --> 00:13:39,690
is to prepare for the wedding.

215
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:44,790
Who she marries

216
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:46,480
isn't up to you.

217
00:13:46,630 --> 00:13:47,840
It's up to her!

218
00:13:49,030 --> 00:13:50,120
Murong Qingyi,

219
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:52,600
even if you want to throw yourself at her,

220
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:54,000
what else can you do for her right now

221
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:55,400
besides taking a bullet?

222
00:13:57,270 --> 00:13:58,930
The downfall of the Huos today

223
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:01,050
wasn't because of your few punches

224
00:14:01,510 --> 00:14:04,440
but the influence and prestige
of our Murong family.

225
00:14:04,550 --> 00:14:05,950
I don't have to force her.

226
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:07,600
She knows what to choose.

227
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:15,150
Miss Fang,

228
00:14:16,150 --> 00:14:17,410
there's a call for you.

229
00:14:29,150 --> 00:14:30,000
Notify Yinwei

230
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:31,120
to find him.

231
00:14:33,630 --> 00:14:34,440
Principal,

232
00:14:34,630 --> 00:14:35,840
Inspector Li sent word.

233
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:37,770
Master Huo's broken out of prison.

234
00:14:41,960 --> 00:14:43,090
Seal off the wharves

235
00:14:43,510 --> 00:14:45,200
and block off all intersections.

236
00:14:45,200 --> 00:14:47,480
None may exit the Huo residence
after entry.

237
00:14:47,480 --> 00:14:47,960
Yes.

238
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:52,480
Stop right there.

239
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:55,340
With me around,

240
00:14:56,960 --> 00:14:59,220
it'll never be your turn to play the hero.

241
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:06,500
Wow, aren't you a mastermind?

242
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:07,970
You make it seem like

243
00:15:08,630 --> 00:15:11,120
I'm absolute trash
without the Murong title.

244
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:12,320
I'll prove to you that

245
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:14,200
even without the Murongs' backing,

246
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:16,260
I can still help her fulfill her wish.

247
00:15:16,390 --> 00:15:17,720
What are you going to do?

248
00:15:23,390 --> 00:15:24,520
What am I going to do?

249
00:15:26,910 --> 00:15:28,510
You'll never get it, Qingyu.

250
00:15:30,480 --> 00:15:31,510
You and I...

251
00:15:34,870 --> 00:15:37,070
have never been cut from the same cloth.

252
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:39,360
To abandon the love of my life

253
00:15:39,360 --> 00:15:41,290
for the sake of my family
would be to

254
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:43,530
destroy my soul.

255
00:15:45,630 --> 00:15:47,090
What are you trying to say?

256
00:15:55,320 --> 00:15:56,120
Qingyu,

257
00:15:56,960 --> 00:15:58,890
I don't know what you're thinking,

258
00:16:00,030 --> 00:16:00,910
but I know

259
00:16:01,480 --> 00:16:02,480
Ms. Ye must be...

260
00:16:04,480 --> 00:16:05,630
very sad.

261
00:16:27,670 --> 00:16:28,600
Where's Qingyi?

262
00:16:30,150 --> 00:16:31,280
I need to talk to you.

263
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:51,520
Congrats, Young Master.

264
00:16:52,790 --> 00:16:55,450
You're becoming more and more
like your mother.

265
00:16:57,510 --> 00:16:59,440
You know how much he looks up to you,

266
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:01,750
yet time and again,

267
00:17:01,750 --> 00:17:04,079
you crush and interfere with
his choices.

268
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:07,099
Is he really your brother,

269
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:09,000
or just a tool you use

270
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:10,800
to spruce up the Murongs' image?

271
00:17:11,349 --> 00:17:12,069
Who are you to

272
00:17:12,069 --> 00:17:14,200
judge my relationship with Qingyi?

273
00:17:14,829 --> 00:17:16,310
He can like any woman,

274
00:17:17,109 --> 00:17:19,770
but absolutely not someone
as dangerous as you.

275
00:17:22,480 --> 00:17:24,550
Do you think that
now that you've had your revenge,

276
00:17:24,550 --> 00:17:26,720
you can pick up where you left off
with Qingyi

277
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:28,450
and rekindle your old romance?

278
00:17:33,270 --> 00:17:34,400
So, in your eyes,

279
00:17:35,350 --> 00:17:36,880
women like us spend our lives

280
00:17:36,880 --> 00:17:37,830
seeking for

281
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:40,110
nothing but to date

282
00:17:40,110 --> 00:17:41,240
noble heirs, huh?

283
00:17:46,350 --> 00:17:47,350
You're spitting on everything

284
00:17:47,350 --> 00:17:49,350
we've been through all these years.

285
00:17:49,880 --> 00:17:51,080
For someone like you,

286
00:17:51,830 --> 00:17:53,960
justice is just a concept you learned.

287
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:55,720
But for people like us,

288
00:17:56,960 --> 00:17:59,890
justice is a luxury
we fight for with blood and tears.

289
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:01,890
You'll never understand this.

290
00:18:03,070 --> 00:18:04,110
But Qingyi does.

291
00:18:08,640 --> 00:18:10,440
I want to go back to being myself.

292
00:18:10,960 --> 00:18:11,620
Fang Mulan,

293
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:13,960
in your dreams.

294
00:18:14,310 --> 00:18:15,550
I'm Ren Susu.

295
00:18:16,230 --> 00:18:17,550
I'm done being Fang Mulan.

296
00:18:17,550 --> 00:18:19,550
Precisely because you're Ren Susu,

297
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:20,790
you must

298
00:18:21,510 --> 00:18:22,720
stay by my side.

299
00:18:23,640 --> 00:18:25,770
The engagement isn't yours to decide.

300
00:18:26,200 --> 00:18:28,000
Master Fang's also in Nancheng.

301
00:18:28,160 --> 00:18:30,420
I'll get him to come talk to you tomorrow.

302
00:18:32,720 --> 00:18:33,790
Twelve years ago,

303
00:18:34,400 --> 00:18:36,200
in a big fire at Wucongkou Wharf,

304
00:18:37,030 --> 00:18:38,070
Ren Changhe...

305
00:18:44,240 --> 00:18:47,550
Papa! Mama! Papa! Mama!

306
00:18:48,920 --> 00:18:50,270
Papa! Mama!

307
00:19:22,640 --> 00:19:23,590
Young Master Qingyi,

308
00:19:23,590 --> 00:19:24,520
please spare me.

309
00:19:27,790 --> 00:19:28,880
Spare you?

310
00:19:36,920 --> 00:19:38,450
If you tell the truth later,

311
00:19:39,160 --> 00:19:40,400
I might consider it.

312
00:19:41,110 --> 00:19:42,000
But if

313
00:19:42,550 --> 00:19:44,550
Master Huo manages to escape,

314
00:19:45,440 --> 00:19:47,500
you'll bear the consequences alone.

315
00:19:51,070 --> 00:19:51,790
Qingyi.

316
00:19:57,030 --> 00:19:57,640
Okay,

317
00:19:58,270 --> 00:20:00,160
I'll tell you everything I know.

318
00:20:00,960 --> 00:20:02,880
He wants to flee abroad.

319
00:20:03,440 --> 00:20:04,960
But all the wharfs in Nancheng

320
00:20:04,960 --> 00:20:06,490
have been sealed off by you.

321
00:20:06,960 --> 00:20:08,070
He's heading to Hangcheng

322
00:20:08,070 --> 00:20:09,110
with his men.

323
00:20:09,720 --> 00:20:10,750
He plans to flee

324
00:20:11,480 --> 00:20:12,590
by boat from there.

325
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:20,640
Qingyi!

326
00:20:26,590 --> 00:20:28,630
[Murong Residence]

327
00:20:36,680 --> 00:20:37,270
Fuzi.

328
00:20:38,960 --> 00:20:39,760
Young Master.

329
00:20:40,110 --> 00:20:41,170
Where's Miss Fang?

330
00:20:41,350 --> 00:20:42,750
She went out earlier.

331
00:20:45,070 --> 00:20:46,130
Qingyi, if we don't

332
00:20:46,160 --> 00:20:46,640
leave now,

333
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:48,720
we won't get to Hangcheng before dark.

334
00:20:48,720 --> 00:20:49,650
It's important.

335
00:20:51,350 --> 00:20:52,410
Get a pen and paper.

336
00:20:52,510 --> 00:20:53,070
Okay.

337
00:21:16,880 --> 00:21:18,030
If I startled you,

338
00:21:18,920 --> 00:21:21,400
please accept the enclosed leaf
of Beicheng's autumn

339
00:21:21,400 --> 00:21:22,730
as a token of my apology.

340
00:21:46,510 --> 00:21:49,980
[Murong Residence]

341
00:21:51,200 --> 00:21:53,000
Miss Fang, you're finally back.

342
00:21:53,240 --> 00:21:56,640
Young Master Qingyi told me to
give this to you before he left.

343
00:21:56,720 --> 00:21:57,750
Before he left?

344
00:22:05,270 --> 00:22:06,730
Huo Shaoxiong's escaped.

345
00:22:07,240 --> 00:22:08,900
I'm going to put an end to this.

346
00:22:09,350 --> 00:22:10,080
Don't worry.

347
00:22:10,720 --> 00:22:12,720
I'll be back before the first snow.

348
00:22:17,160 --> 00:22:17,790
P.S.

349
00:22:18,400 --> 00:22:20,200
contact me if you need anything.

350
00:22:20,200 --> 00:22:20,790
P.P.S.

351
00:22:21,310 --> 00:22:22,970
contact me even just to say hi.

352
00:22:44,960 --> 00:22:45,880
Ren Changhe

353
00:22:46,400 --> 00:22:48,750
made a living from water transport
at the wharves.

354
00:22:48,750 --> 00:22:49,880
Twelve years ago,

355
00:22:50,200 --> 00:22:52,000
in a big fire at Wucongkou Wharf,

356
00:22:52,400 --> 00:22:54,200
over 30 people died in the fire.

357
00:22:54,400 --> 00:22:56,310
This included Ren Changhe

358
00:22:56,550 --> 00:22:58,070
and his wife Shao Huilan.

359
00:22:59,880 --> 00:23:00,740
After the fire,

360
00:23:01,160 --> 00:23:02,890
their only daughter, Ren Susu,

361
00:23:03,590 --> 00:23:05,450
was taken into Renxin Orphanage.

362
00:23:05,550 --> 00:23:06,440
Stop talking.

363
00:23:07,720 --> 00:23:08,450
I already...

364
00:23:09,440 --> 00:23:10,310
know all this.

365
00:23:13,480 --> 00:23:15,080
There's more you don't know.

366
00:23:18,590 --> 00:23:19,320
What's this?

367
00:23:19,820 --> 00:23:22,240
[Current Affairs Daily]

368
00:23:22,270 --> 00:23:24,570
[Bloodshed at Railway Celebration:
Marshal Murong Meets With Misfortune]

369
00:23:22,790 --> 00:23:24,590
After the Wucongkou Wharf fire,

370
00:23:25,030 --> 00:23:28,400
there was an explosion at the inauguration
ceremony of the North-South Railway.

371
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:29,270
My father

372
00:23:29,480 --> 00:23:30,550
died on the spot.

373
00:23:30,750 --> 00:23:32,480
It must be related to this case.

374
00:23:33,030 --> 00:23:33,880
Afterwards,

375
00:23:34,350 --> 00:23:36,270
the mastermind behind it wasn't found.

376
00:23:36,270 --> 00:23:37,870
Only one thing was found out:

377
00:23:38,830 --> 00:23:40,090
the explosive was RDX.

378
00:23:41,200 --> 00:23:43,460
It's a new type of explosive from abroad.

379
00:23:44,030 --> 00:23:45,030
But the key is that

380
00:23:46,110 --> 00:23:47,710
this batch of explosives was

381
00:23:48,110 --> 00:23:49,710
handled at Wucongkou Wharf.

382
00:23:50,310 --> 00:23:51,310
Are you saying

383
00:23:52,680 --> 00:23:53,750
my parents' death

384
00:23:54,030 --> 00:23:55,160
wasn't an accident?

385
00:23:57,590 --> 00:23:59,110
No one's ever connected

386
00:23:59,590 --> 00:24:00,990
the Wucongkou Wharf fire

387
00:24:01,830 --> 00:24:03,640
and the railway explosion

388
00:24:03,640 --> 00:24:04,830
together before.

389
00:24:05,720 --> 00:24:06,880
But now it seems that

390
00:24:07,440 --> 00:24:09,300
perhaps the Wucongkou Wharf fire

391
00:24:09,310 --> 00:24:10,960
was to preemptively destroy

392
00:24:10,960 --> 00:24:13,420
crucial evidence of the railway explosion.

393
00:24:16,720 --> 00:24:18,520
Someone wanted to silence them?

394
00:24:20,350 --> 00:24:22,550
But my parents were just ordinary folk.

395
00:24:22,790 --> 00:24:24,720
How could they be involved in this?

396
00:24:27,890 --> 00:24:30,610
[Marshal Murong, clad in ceremonial garb,
was about to cut the ribbon and speak]

397
00:24:30,640 --> 00:24:31,920
Who benefits from...

398
00:24:34,400 --> 00:24:35,800
Marshal Murong's death?

399
00:24:38,200 --> 00:24:39,110
Li Rongzhang.

400
00:24:44,830 --> 00:24:45,620
[P.S. contact me if you need anything.]

401
00:24:45,640 --> 00:24:46,700
[P.P.S. contact me even just to say hi.]

402
00:24:49,200 --> 00:24:51,720
Qingyi, what should I do?

403
00:25:12,680 --> 00:25:14,160
Master, careful.

404
00:25:15,960 --> 00:25:16,480
Hurry.

405
00:25:18,880 --> 00:25:20,310
Why so slow? Faster!

406
00:25:21,070 --> 00:25:21,590
Hurry!

407
00:25:21,200 --> 00:25:24,450
[Hangcheng Wharf]

408
00:25:22,960 --> 00:25:24,590
Master, be careful.

409
00:25:26,550 --> 00:25:27,030
Come on.

410
00:25:27,240 --> 00:25:27,720
Here.

411
00:25:31,270 --> 00:25:32,200
Hoist the sails.

412
00:25:32,200 --> 00:25:32,920
Set sail!

413
00:25:41,480 --> 00:25:42,310
Master,

414
00:25:42,310 --> 00:25:43,640
good thing you were prepared,

415
00:25:43,640 --> 00:25:45,170
so we could save our assets.

416
00:25:46,830 --> 00:25:48,400
Once we get through this,

417
00:25:49,240 --> 00:25:50,310
our Huo family

418
00:25:51,030 --> 00:25:52,830
will prevail, powerful as ever.

419
00:25:57,000 --> 00:25:58,000
Why's it so light?

420
00:26:00,200 --> 00:26:00,790
Master,

421
00:26:01,240 --> 00:26:01,840
this is...

422
00:26:05,510 --> 00:26:06,750
Master, the money...

423
00:26:07,440 --> 00:26:09,170
has all turned into joss paper.

424
00:26:10,720 --> 00:26:12,720
Where's my money? Where is it!

425
00:26:14,400 --> 00:26:15,400
Master Huo.

426
00:26:18,960 --> 00:26:20,830
Setting sail so late at night,

427
00:26:20,830 --> 00:26:22,070
where are you going?

428
00:26:23,200 --> 00:26:24,960
It's you, you bastard!

429
00:26:27,000 --> 00:26:28,480
In such a hurry, you might've

430
00:26:28,480 --> 00:26:30,310
not prepared your own joss paper,

431
00:26:30,310 --> 00:26:32,270
so I brought some gifts for you.

432
00:26:32,400 --> 00:26:33,330
Do you like them?

433
00:27:09,720 --> 00:27:12,640
Three years ago, you ruined my left hand.

434
00:27:13,640 --> 00:27:14,640
Over the years...

435
00:27:16,400 --> 00:27:17,800
the spasms, the tremors,

436
00:27:18,160 --> 00:27:19,550
and the piercing pain

437
00:27:21,030 --> 00:27:22,960
have tortured me nonstop.

438
00:27:25,790 --> 00:27:26,590
Master Huo...

439
00:27:28,240 --> 00:27:29,310
now,

440
00:27:30,240 --> 00:27:31,240
your left hand

441
00:27:32,720 --> 00:27:34,250
can feel my pain too, right?

442
00:27:51,590 --> 00:27:52,520
What black magic

443
00:27:52,830 --> 00:27:54,070
did you use on me?

444
00:27:56,070 --> 00:27:57,240
Not me

445
00:27:57,790 --> 00:27:58,830
but her.

446
00:28:05,480 --> 00:28:06,830
Knowing Master Huo,

447
00:28:07,590 --> 00:28:09,120
he won't surrender easily.

448
00:28:09,960 --> 00:28:11,890
Even if he finds a chance to escape,

449
00:28:12,480 --> 00:28:13,640
we can't let him off.

450
00:28:20,240 --> 00:28:21,590
This hallucinatory drug

451
00:28:21,590 --> 00:28:23,590
magnifies pain and injury,

452
00:28:24,110 --> 00:28:25,480
until he dies of terror.

453
00:28:28,750 --> 00:28:30,510
You two animals!

454
00:28:36,750 --> 00:28:37,880
Over a decade ago,

455
00:28:38,110 --> 00:28:40,440
when you spilled your first drop of blood,

456
00:28:40,440 --> 00:28:42,300
you should've expected this day.

457
00:28:42,880 --> 00:28:43,880
I won't...

458
00:28:44,680 --> 00:28:46,110
let you two go.

459
00:29:19,880 --> 00:29:21,160
Trying to provoke me

460
00:29:21,640 --> 00:29:23,500
so I'd shoot you for a quick death?

461
00:29:24,000 --> 00:29:25,930
That'd be letting you off too easy.

462
00:30:46,400 --> 00:30:47,850
[Zhenhua No. 1 Aviation School]

463
00:30:57,680 --> 00:30:59,280
I've had people look into it.

464
00:30:59,550 --> 00:31:00,070
The Huo family

465
00:31:00,070 --> 00:31:02,680
has always held the outside shares
for Baohua Firm,

466
00:31:02,680 --> 00:31:04,140
where your father worked.

467
00:31:05,030 --> 00:31:06,270
With the fall of the Huos,

468
00:31:06,270 --> 00:31:07,310
some news

469
00:31:07,480 --> 00:31:08,750
finally came to light.

470
00:31:09,030 --> 00:31:10,310
We also found letters

471
00:31:10,310 --> 00:31:12,440
between the Huos and various parties,

472
00:31:12,480 --> 00:31:14,880
and discovered that before the explosion,

473
00:31:14,960 --> 00:31:17,490
they were in close contact
with Li Rongzhang.

474
00:31:23,350 --> 00:31:24,810
I didn't expect it either.

475
00:31:25,790 --> 00:31:28,120
Back then, although the Lis and our family

476
00:31:28,640 --> 00:31:30,920
were fighting for control of the railway,

477
00:31:30,920 --> 00:31:32,310
after the explosion,

478
00:31:33,200 --> 00:31:35,110
Li Rongzhang was also implicated.

479
00:31:35,110 --> 00:31:35,750
He almost

480
00:31:36,110 --> 00:31:37,680
lost command of the army.

481
00:31:38,240 --> 00:31:39,350
In that case,

482
00:31:40,160 --> 00:31:41,110
why'd he hurt others

483
00:31:41,110 --> 00:31:42,770
when he gets nothing out of it?

484
00:31:43,960 --> 00:31:46,090
We kept investigating along this line

485
00:31:46,830 --> 00:31:48,490
and found that the explosives

486
00:31:48,590 --> 00:31:50,750
were indeed supplied by
Li Rongzhang's partner,

487
00:31:50,750 --> 00:31:52,590
an overseas arms supplier.

488
00:31:55,750 --> 00:31:57,070
Since the explosives were transported

489
00:31:57,070 --> 00:31:58,470
through Wucongkou Wharf

490
00:31:58,830 --> 00:32:00,760
and Baohua Firm was also involved,

491
00:32:01,440 --> 00:32:04,040
Li Rongzhang had every reason
to silence them,

492
00:32:04,640 --> 00:32:06,640
killing dozens of innocent people,

493
00:32:06,790 --> 00:32:08,250
including the Ren family.

494
00:32:12,510 --> 00:32:14,590
-That means...
-That means that

495
00:32:14,920 --> 00:32:16,480
if you want revenge,

496
00:32:18,070 --> 00:32:20,470
you have to kill Qingyi's adoptive father,

497
00:32:20,960 --> 00:32:22,890
that is Boze's biological father.

498
00:32:29,400 --> 00:32:30,070
What,

499
00:32:31,440 --> 00:32:32,470
want revenge?

500
00:32:34,000 --> 00:32:35,330
I'll offer you a choice.

501
00:32:37,350 --> 00:32:38,410
Our wedding will be

502
00:32:39,270 --> 00:32:41,870
your best chance to
assassinate Li Rongzhang.

503
00:32:43,240 --> 00:32:44,720
Even if I succeed,

504
00:32:45,160 --> 00:32:47,220
I can't escape the Lis' retaliation.

505
00:32:47,480 --> 00:32:49,680
I'll most likely die on the spot.

506
00:32:49,790 --> 00:32:50,720
You want revenge

507
00:32:51,960 --> 00:32:53,490
but you're afraid of death?

508
00:32:54,880 --> 00:32:55,720
Ren Susu,

509
00:32:56,680 --> 00:32:58,280
you're unlike your old self.

510
00:33:12,400 --> 00:33:13,270
I see.

511
00:33:14,350 --> 00:33:15,880
This matter is deeply interconnected

512
00:33:15,880 --> 00:33:17,000
and full of perils.

513
00:33:17,640 --> 00:33:19,110
You don't want a ticking time bomb like me

514
00:33:19,110 --> 00:33:20,570
staying by Qingyi's side.

515
00:33:21,400 --> 00:33:23,200
Will you only join forces with me

516
00:33:23,640 --> 00:33:24,960
if I leave Qingyi?

517
00:33:27,030 --> 00:33:27,920
Or would you

518
00:33:28,240 --> 00:33:30,500
rather I fight Li Rongzhang to the death,

519
00:33:32,070 --> 00:33:33,160
since my death...

520
00:33:34,920 --> 00:33:36,400
would be best for Qingyi?

521
00:33:43,920 --> 00:33:45,180
I don't need your help,

522
00:33:45,480 --> 00:33:47,010
and I'm not leaving Qingyi.

523
00:33:47,880 --> 00:33:49,310
As for my parents' revenge,

524
00:33:49,310 --> 00:33:50,640
I will bide my time.

525
00:33:52,720 --> 00:33:54,450
Who will let you bide your time?

526
00:33:59,200 --> 00:34:00,060
The Fang family

527
00:34:00,920 --> 00:34:01,830
or Qingyi?

528
00:34:02,350 --> 00:34:03,750
If you're not Fang Mulan,

529
00:34:04,830 --> 00:34:07,240
why involve the Fang family
in something so dangerous

530
00:34:07,240 --> 00:34:09,300
like Li Rongzhang's assassination?

531
00:34:11,190 --> 00:34:11,590
Well,

532
00:34:12,320 --> 00:34:13,520
if you can't seek help

533
00:34:13,670 --> 00:34:15,270
from the Fangs, then Qingyi?

534
00:34:15,590 --> 00:34:17,000
Do I need to remind you?

535
00:34:17,190 --> 00:34:19,449
Li Rongzhang doesn't treat Qingyi well,

536
00:34:19,480 --> 00:34:21,480
but he's still his adoptive father.

537
00:34:21,590 --> 00:34:23,360
What gives you the right to make Qingyi

538
00:34:23,360 --> 00:34:24,920
commit patricide for you?

539
00:34:27,230 --> 00:34:28,550
Without the Fang family,

540
00:34:28,550 --> 00:34:29,480
without Qingyi,

541
00:34:29,920 --> 00:34:32,960
what do you, the orphan Ren Susu, have?

542
00:34:34,190 --> 00:34:36,120
Your life's all you have, isn't it?

543
00:34:41,320 --> 00:34:43,250
At the wedding, even if I succeed in

544
00:34:43,320 --> 00:34:45,280
assassinating Li Rongzhang and die,

545
00:34:45,280 --> 00:34:46,920
you can't escape involvement.

546
00:34:46,920 --> 00:34:48,449
What do you want out of this?

547
00:34:50,670 --> 00:34:52,469
Now that the Huos are destroyed,

548
00:34:53,230 --> 00:34:55,560
the power in Nancheng will be reshuffled.

549
00:34:55,630 --> 00:34:57,550
If you assassinate Li Rongzhang,

550
00:34:58,000 --> 00:34:59,920
the power of both the Huos and the Lis

551
00:34:59,920 --> 00:35:01,250
will fall into my hands.

552
00:35:03,630 --> 00:35:05,490
Do you really think I believe that

553
00:35:06,030 --> 00:35:07,510
you're this power-hungry?

554
00:35:07,510 --> 00:35:08,590
Believe it or not,

555
00:35:10,000 --> 00:35:11,530
now, you just need to choose

556
00:35:12,000 --> 00:35:13,070
if you'll shoulder

557
00:35:13,480 --> 00:35:14,810
the Rens' grudge or not.

558
00:35:34,760 --> 00:35:35,480
Principal,

559
00:35:36,000 --> 00:35:38,710
assassinating Li Rongzhang
is immensely dangerous,

560
00:35:38,710 --> 00:35:40,110
and Miss Fang's just a weak woman...

561
00:35:40,110 --> 00:35:41,110
So what?

562
00:35:42,320 --> 00:35:44,180
Regardless of her doubts, this is

563
00:35:44,590 --> 00:35:46,520
an inevitable path she has to take.

564
00:35:47,000 --> 00:35:49,400
Even if we don't consider
Miss Fang's life,

565
00:35:49,400 --> 00:35:50,280
it isn't do or die

566
00:35:50,280 --> 00:35:52,080
between us and Li Rongzhang yet.

567
00:35:53,440 --> 00:35:55,370
Killing him now for past events...

568
00:35:56,630 --> 00:35:57,320
Principal,

569
00:35:57,920 --> 00:35:59,320
you're not a rash person.

570
00:35:59,920 --> 00:36:01,520
There's a reason he must die.

571
00:36:01,920 --> 00:36:03,920
But he's still
Young Master Qingyi's adoptive father

572
00:36:03,920 --> 00:36:05,510
